Talks":[],"npcId":[21732],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Natian_75124/Q7512403","priority":5,"questId":75124,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":751240301,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21732,"speakerName":"Jonvelle","textMapHash":3217472874,"text":"Ah, such lovely timing...","nextNodeIds":[751240302]},{"nodeId":751240302,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21732,"speakerName":"Jonvelle","textMapHash":867900002,"text":"I can barely believe that my photo-taking quest, which had eluded me no matter how hard I tried, was completed so quickly with your help...","nextNodeIds":[751240303]},{"nodeId":751240303,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21732,"speakerName":"Jonvelle","textMapHash":1177281394,"text":"All these Flowcurrent Birds, their bobbing, rolling forms sitting within their swim rings! A sight so moving as to bring one to tears...","nextNodeIds":[751240304]},{"nodeId":751240304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3814801122,"text":"Is it really that moving...","nextNodeIds":[751240305]},{"nodeId":751240305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21732,"speakerName":"Jonvelle","textMapHash":3534882314,"text":"Sometimes, we make our life's pursuit out of something that others cannot understand — indeed, even consider absurd.","nextNodeIds":[751240306]},{"nodeId":751240306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21732,"speakerName":"Jonvelle","textMapHash":533724546,"text":"Nonetheless, I believe that the number of Flowcurrent Bird enthusiasts in the world shall increase, so long as I keep taking these photos!","nextNodeIds":[751240307]},{"nodeId":751240307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4147596578,"text":"Paimon one hundred percent believes in this future too!","nextNodeIds":[751240308]},{"nodeId":751240308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21732,"speakerName":"Jonvelle","textMapHash":2919764522,"text":"Ah, thank you both so much for your